/*!
\page page_stetofdigi StETofDigi

\brief Electronic digitisation from a single MRPC strip-end in the STAR Endcap TOF (eTOF).

\section etofdigi_overview Overview

StETofDigi represents a single digitised signal from one end of an MRPC strip
in the STAR Endcap TOF (eTOF) detector, operational since Run 19 (2019).

Each MRPC strip is read from two sides (top and bottom).
Two matching digis — one from each side of the same strip — are merged by the hit-finding algorithm
to form a single \ref StETofHit.

A digi carries:
- \b Geometry address: sector, z-plane, counter, strip, side.
- \b Hardware address: ROC ID, Get4 TDC chip ID, electronic channel.
- \b Raw and calibrated time and time-over-threshold (ToT).

Digis are stored in \ref StETofCollection via StEvent::etofCollection().

\section etofdigi_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code{.txt}
TObject → StObject → StETofDigi
\endcode

\section etofdigi_members Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| mSector | UInt_t | STAR sector number |
| mZPlane | UInt_t | z-plane number (1–3) |
| mCounter | UInt_t | Counter (MRPC) number (1–3) |
| mStrip | UInt_t | Strip number within counter (1–32) |
| mSide | UInt_t | Readout side: 1=top, 2=bottom |
| mRocId | UInt_t | Readout Controller (ROC) hardware ID |
| mGet4Id | UInt_t | Get4 TDC chip hardware ID |
| mElChan | UInt_t | Electronic channel within Get4 |
| mRawTime | Double_t | Uncalibrated time from TDC [ns] |
| mCalibTime | Double_t | Calibrated time [ns] |
| mRawTot | Double_t | Uncalibrated time-over-threshold [ns] |
| mCalibTot | Double_t | Calibrated time-over-threshold [ns] |
| mAssociatedHit | StETofHit* | Merged hit formed from this digi |

\section etofdigi_methods Key Methods

- sector(), zPlane(), counter(), strip(), side() — geometry address
- rocId(), get4Id(), elChan() — hardware address
- rawTime(), calibTime() — timing [ns]
- rawTot(), calibTot() — time-over-threshold [ns]
- rawCharge() / calibCharge() — aliases for rawTot() / calibTot()
- associatedHit() — pointer to merged \ref StETofHit
- setGeoAddress(sector, zPlane, counter, channel, side) — set geometry in one call
- setHwAddress(rocId, get4Id, elChan) — set hardware address
- operator<, compare() — sort/compare by calibrated time

\section etofdigi_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
StETofCollection* coll = event->etofCollection();
if (coll) {
    const StSPtrVecETofDigi& digis = coll->etofDigis();
    for (const auto& d : digis) {
        unsigned int strip    = d->strip();      // 1–32
        unsigned int side     = d->side();       // 1=top, 2=bottom
        double       rawTime  = d->rawTime();    // [ns]
        double       calibTot = d->calibTot();   // [ns]
        if (d->associatedHit())
            double hitTime = d->associatedHit()->time();
    }
}
\endcode

\see StETofHit, StETofHeader, StETofCollection
*/
